A note is a finding of some type, which is indicated by the note name. Finding
notes are named `<type>[finding]`.

Use `mcp__gage__Query` to read docs for finding note types.

```sql
SELECT note_name, doc FROM note_doc
WHERE note_name LIKE '%[finding]'
```

